        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukudla kukaSolomoni ngosuku kwakungamasaka angamatshumi amahlanu empuphu ecolekileyo, lamasaka alikhulu empuphu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lenkabi ezilitshumi ezinonisiweyo, lamatshumi amabili enkomo ezivela emadlelweni, lezimvu ezilikhulu, ngaphandle kwempala lemiziki lempunzi lengalukhuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba wayebusa lonke ilizwe elingasentshonalanga komfula iYufrathi kusukela eTifisa kusiya eGaza, lawo wonke amakhosi angasentshonalanga komfula iYufrathi, kukhona ukuthula kuzo zonke indawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoJuda labakoIsrayeli babevikelekile kusukela koDani kuze kufike eBerisheba, bonke babezihlalela ngaphansi kwezihlahla zabo zevini langaphansi kwezomkhiwa kuzo zonke insuku zokubusa kukaSolomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wayelezibaya zamabhiza enqola zakhe zokulwa ezizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amane, lamabhiza okulwa ayezinkulungwane ezilitshumi lambili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
